{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_aosta_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_aosta_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "编织来日",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_aosta_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "cd454f71f8f107e993b5a717d74181373a63704cc9628e40ec7066b49e11ed50",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "在这里！我看到他啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "术师干员",
      "text": "嗯来了来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "唔，你们好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "已经做好了，看一看符合心意吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "喔喔——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "术师干员",
      "text": "嗬，真的是你做的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "我没想到这么快就做好了！好、好可爱！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "做的时候有了一些灵感，所以时间比想象中用得少，还有想修改的地方吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "我完全没有意见，这就是我想要的样子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "喏，这是当时定好的报酬~顺便，我们前几天在厨房烤了些饼干，也请收下尝尝吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "饼干吗？唔，谢谢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "嘿嘿，我越看越喜欢，你领子内衬用的材料也好好哦！摸上去软软的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "对，我试过好几种材料，还是这种更柔软一点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "那几天为了挑材料真是费了不少事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "那你是在宿舍里做这衣服的吗，需要的材料会很多吧？我前阵子沉迷积木的时候也是，不知不觉占用了太多公共空间，已经被骂咯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "你的舍友会对这个有意见吗？要是因为我你们之间有了矛盾，我会有点过意不去的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "那倒没有，他们都知道我这个爱好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "不过，柏喙干员申请了一个纺织室，你也可以去和后勤部申请一下，这样材料就不用堆在宿舍里了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "或者你可以在舰上开个摊的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "柏喙小姐基本上只主动去找人做衣服，梓兰小姐基本上是提供一些穿搭经验，你要是开个小摊，就是独一份呀！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "术师干员",
      "text": "不过看你的表情，你是不是还没和她们说过话？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "嗯......是的。说实在的，你们都是听了贾维的话才来找我的，但我其实还没想过要给其他干员做衣服挂件这些事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "我也还不认识你说的这两位干员。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "术师干员",
      "text": "我就这么一提啦~不过柏喙和梓兰小姐她们都是很好相处的人，你要是想和她们聊聊，肯定不会有问题的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "术师干员",
      "text": "那位就是柏喙小姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "叫我吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "啊、啊，不好意思！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "这里就是我的仓库了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "今天我还邀请了梓兰姐，她会来给其他干员们教教设计，你要是有什么知道的缝纫知识，也可以教给大家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "打扰了，只是我原本是打算来问点问题，可能没什么能教的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "没事没事，我其实也没什么能教给大家的东西，只是互相交流一下自己关于缝纫的想法，你能来，我很感谢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "柏喙？我来啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "梓兰姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "这位是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "您好，我是奥斯塔，今天也一起来上课。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "“您”？不用这么礼貌啦。你比我组里的人看起来顺眼多了，和他们待久了，有点不敢相信罗德岛上还有这样的好孩子......啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "认真的干员",
      "text": "真好，我还以为只有我一个男干员呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "抱歉，我是最后一个来的吗？给大家带了一点小吃，空闲时间可以尝一点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "谢谢梓兰姐，那我们开始吧~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "整个仓库逐渐充满了小声但热烈的讨论，所有人都沉浸在缝纫的世界里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "（呃，现在就去问肯定不太好。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "（他们看起来都互相认识，我要不要过去融入一下话题？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "（柏喙干员和梓兰干员......源石结晶......啊。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "（她们二位也得了矿石病啊......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "（看上去都好开心，是因为找到了自己喜欢做的事吗？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "（这个仓库......里面放满了柏喙干员的材料啊，怪不得那个干员也建议我申请一下。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "认真的干员",
      "text": "打扰了，请问你知道这种毛线包怎么编吗？我想当礼物送给一个人，但是自己试了好久都不行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "认真的干员",
      "text": "她们都在忙，我想来问一下你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "柏喙和梓兰已经全身心地投入到讨论中去，无暇分心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "......哦，好的，让我来看一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "是图片上这种样式的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "我明白了......这种编法有些复杂，如果有那种固定编织的工作台......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "认真的干员",
      "text": "是这种吗？在这里有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "对，我先试验一下，看我想的是不是正确的，你稍等一会儿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "认真的干员",
      "text": "嗯，谢谢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "......你说用这种毛线会不会光泽度更好一点？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "认真的干员",
      "text": "唔，灯照上去确实会比原来这条看上去温润一些，她应该会喜欢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "......还有这种，在毛线里穿上这些碎粒，会增加一些......说不出来，但更加精致了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "认真的干员",
      "text": "我看看......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "认真的干员",
      "text": "哇哦，你叫奥斯塔对吗，你接不接单？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "嗯？啊，接的，你有什么需求——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "认真的干员",
      "text": "等下，你的袖子这里破了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "认真的干员",
      "text": "桌子上这根钉子支出来了，是不是刚才挂在上面扯坏了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "不要紧，缝一下就好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "那个，请问针在哪里......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "在你背后，柜子抽屉拉开——第三层？或者第四层！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "你还需要线吗？我还带来了点别的材料，在那个箱子里，你都可以随便用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "谢谢，我只用一下针线就好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "嗯？我以为你是在缝东西，原来你是在补自己的衣服？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "哎呀，这个针脚，是不是衣服穿在身上你不太方便补？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "奥斯塔干员，要不然你先把外套脱了，我们这里也不缺材料，你放在桌上好好补一下？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "赶紧过来，你这个口子太不雅观了，我给你缝上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "线呢？这里还剩一卷......这是白的还是黑的？好脏，你是带着它在泥里开派对了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "嗯......花的？看不出来，你管他呢，能用就行！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "别忘了，做完这个活，我们回去后还要去买布料，做点新的衣服。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "对，去年的教训一定要记住，便宜的不能要，原料太差了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "谁知道它用的是劣质染料啊，那疹子可真够疼的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "下回穿之前多洗几次吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "啊，我以前都是这样补的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "因为这种布料很耐磨，随手补一下，又能继续穿很久。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "认真的干员",
      "text": "可是你刚才给我编那个毛线包的时候，用的都是好东西啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "那是因为在帮你做东西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "别人的委托自然要好好做完，我的衣服当时设计的时候选用的就是耐磨的材料，用粗线针距大一点更不会被磨破，实用性上——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "嘶？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "认真的干员",
      "text": "怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "认真的干员",
      "text": "看来是钉子把你的胳膊也划破了，刚才一直都没觉得疼吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "没事，破了一点点，也不流血了，我抹一下就行了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "被划破了吗？等下，我这里......果然有！随身带的创可贴，备了好几个呢，因为不知道什么时候在哪里就能用到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "把胳膊伸出来。我自己还备了个小医疗箱，就害怕谁哪天磕碰了，可以救个急......我怎么这么熟练？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "算了，过来吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "其实不用——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "好好消毒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "......好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "噗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "就算伤口只有一点点，被钉子划破了也是要消毒的，万一上面有锈之类的东西，感染了可是大问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "......哦哦？你这个表情我好像在谁脸上看到过，你是不是想说这点小伤不算什么之类的话？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "以前不管怎么样都是以前，现在你在罗德岛上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "有条件了当然就要把条件运用到最好，对吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "嗯......贴好了，谢谢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "我继续做吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "认真的干员",
      "text": "剩下的我来吧？我在旁边已经看得差不多了，而且本来就是我要送给别人的礼物，你衣服和胳膊都破了，我还拜托你继续做，说不过去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "认真的干员",
      "text": "不过真的很谢谢你！帮了我这么大一个忙，下次你出任务我也跟着，结束后我给你买件新的外套！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "认真的干员",
      "text": "嘿嘿，我从小都想这么干，等我有能力自己挣钱，一定要买什么礼物好好感谢身边帮了我的人，你这个兄弟我交上了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "我今天一直在想一个问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "说说看？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "你们小时候有没有想过长大了以后要成为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "还有这种事？我想的是什么......成为家族老大？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "......没想过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "我之前......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "在拿起武器之前，在父亲让我跟随他之前......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "我想成为一名公务员，过那种安稳的生活。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "下针可以再大胆点，不用担心会把布料扎坏，刚开始都是这样的，留下针眼了还有别的方法嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "有想法就要去尝试，不要因为害怕会做坏就不做啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "想遮住身上的源石啊，放心，这样一搭配就什么都看不出来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "不过我最近也在想，我为什么要把它一直藏着呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "我也这样想过......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "还是我来把它编完吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "（啊，本来还想跟她们聊聊的。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "（......现在看来，不去聊也没什么问题了？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "（我好像一直没能想清楚这件事情。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "认真的干员",
      "text": "奥斯塔......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "唔，不好意思，走了一下神。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "等我把这个毛线包编完，你们可以帮我一起来选一下做外套的布料吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "我想听一下你们的意见。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柏喙",
      "text": "好呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓兰",
      "text": "终于开窍了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "认真的干员",
      "text": "我也一起！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "谢谢你们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "或许这个就是他想要的生活方式，或许自己可以尝试去抓住它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "......这些布料......刚才他们几个硬塞给我的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "要做点什么好好谢谢他们才行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "还有刚才柏喙说的......她想让我也多一点尝试，她自己走出来了以后觉得走出来很好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "呀呼——！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "嗬？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "嘿嘿！猜猜我刚才干了什么！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "没兴趣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "小爷我刚才可是——技压群雄！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "哎，别走呀！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "看看这是什么？是谁获得了冠军？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "是小爷！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "罗德岛第一届嘴里塞小圆饼大赛，二十六个！谁还能强过小爷我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "居然有人和你一起疯，食堂阿姨也没打死你？真是命大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "嘿嘿，那我都吃下去了，又不是浪费。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "布洛卡呢？他又去哪了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "我可要好好说给他听听，跟你说一点劲都没有！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "跟我说没劲？那你可要好好跟他吹嘘一下，最好明天我能在《罗德岛每日新闻报》上看到你勇夺第一的超大头条。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "那小爷我可要——我们还有新闻报这东西？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "没有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "你可以是个起点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "别以为我听不出来你在损我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "不说了，刚才那个是不是布洛卡？我走咯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈，冠军！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈，看我！我在这里画了幅画！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "这是什么东西？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "......哇哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "看不出来吗？小爷我痛击家族手下的英勇场景！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "哎，笑一下嘛！至于吗？不就是又被追着打，咱们这样的次数还少吗？等他们追来了再跑不就行了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贾维",
      "text": "车都在这里，想那么多干什么！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "......嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "这里真的是安全得......不像样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "奥斯塔手里仍旧是那几卷布料样品，它们沉重但柔软，很温暖。\n他看着贾维跑远的身影，飞起来的头发丝里都写满了开心，不再是以前苦中作乐的样子。\n奥斯塔迈开步子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "博士，今天是我做助理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
      "text": "需要我做什么吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "暂时还没有，你可以先在旁边坐坐。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
          "text": "好的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "奥斯塔",
          "text": "博士，我能在舰内开一家DIY室吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
